  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4305.04 Reporting and Recordkeeping Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4305.04 Reporting and Recordkeeping Requirements. The owner or operator of an existing OSWI unit shall comply with the reporting and recordkeeping requirements specified in 40 CFR §60.3019, §60.3020, and §60.3046 through §60.3057.\n\nSource. #10765, eff 1-22-15; ss by #14248, eff 5-20-25, EXPIRES: 5-20-35\n\nAPPENDIX",
